{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29375","headline":"七月二十八日夜与王郑二秀才听雨後梦作 · 李商隐","name":"七月二十八日夜与王郑二秀才听雨後梦作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初梦龙宫宝焰然，瑞霞明丽满晴天。\n旋成醉倚蓬莱树，有个仙人拍我肩。\n少顷远闻吹细管，闻声不见隔飞烟。\n逡巡又过潇湘雨，雨打湘灵五十弦。\n瞥见冯夷殊怅望，鲛绡休卖海爲田。\n亦逢毛女无憀极，龙伯擎将华岳莲。\n恍惚无倪明又暗，低迷不已断还连。\n觉来正是平阶雨，独背寒灯枕手眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}